# Task B06_isolation_bytes (complete)

## Specification
Cross-tenant isolation at byte granularity: with rows of rowBytes bytes per slot, two different requests never touch the same byte of the KV pool.

## Code under verification (src/runtime/paged_kv_indexer.cu :: paged_kv_gather_kernel)
```cuda
// Grid-stride loop over the flattened [n_slots, row_elems] output; consecutive lanes copy
// consecutive elements of one KV row, so both the cache read and the output write coalesce.
extern "C" GLIMMER_KERNEL void paged_kv_gather_kernel(const float* GLIMMER_RESTRICT kv_cache,
                                                      std::int64_t num_slots_total, std::int32_t row_elems,
                                                      const std::int64_t* GLIMMER_RESTRICT slots,
                                                      std::int32_t n_slots, float* GLIMMER_RESTRICT out) {
  const std::int64_t total = static_cast<std::int64_t>(n_slots) * row_elems;
  const std::int64_t stride = static_cast<std::int64_t>(gridDim.x) * blockDim.x;
  for (std::int64_t idx = static_cast<std::int64_t>(blockIdx.x) * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x; idx < total;
       idx += stride) {
    const std::int64_t q = idx / row_elems;
    const std::int64_t e = idx - q * row_elems;
    const std::int64_t slot = slots[q];
    out[idx] = (slot >= 0 && slot < num_slots_total) ? GLIMMER_LDG(kv_cache + slot * row_elems + e) : 0.0f;
  }
}
```

## Template `B06_isolation_bytes.lean`
Replace every `sorry`; keep all other text exactly as is.
```lean
import GlimmerVerify.PagedKVProofs

/-!
B06: byte-level cross-tenant isolation.

Each KV slot holds a row of `rowBytes` bytes, and byte `e < rowBytes` of slot `s` lives at
`s * rowBytes + e`. Lifting `GlimmerVerify.paged_kv_isolation` from slots to bytes: two different
requests never touch the same byte of the KV pool, whatever the (non-literal) row width.
-/

namespace GlimmerVerify.Bench

open GlimmerVerify

theorem paged_kv_isolation_bytes (A : KVAllocator) (hiso : A.Isolated) {a b pa pb ea eb rowBytes : Nat}
    (hab : a ≠ b) (ha : A.Owns a pa) (hb : A.Owns b pb) (hea : ea < rowBytes) (heb : eb < rowBytes) :
    physSlot A.table a pa * rowBytes + ea ≠ physSlot A.table b pb * rowBytes + eb := by
  sorry

end GlimmerVerify.Bench
```

Required theorems (checked with `#print axioms`): `GlimmerVerify.Bench.paged_kv_isolation_bytes`
